    <bpmn:process id="W_W4547" name="W4547. Captive Finance, Statutory Accounting &amp; Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Month/quarter/year close (VS-17); statutory cycle
Frequency: Monthly/quarterly/annual
Volume: Captive books + statutory statements + group consolidation
Owner: Finance (VS-17) / Captive Board / Treasury (VS-18)
Participants: Actuarial, Tax (VS-79), Audit (VS-21), Domiciliary rules
Source: workflow W4547 — Captive Finance, Statutory Accounting &amp; Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4547_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4547_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4547_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4547_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4547_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4547_Lane2" name="Captive Board">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4547_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4547_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4547_Start4" name="Month/quarter/year close (VS-17); statutory cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4547_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4547_Task5" name="Finance maintain captive books (premium, losses/reserves W4542, reinsurance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance maintain captive books (premium, losses/reserves W4542, reinsurance W4546, investment W4550, expenses) per statutory accounting (domicile) &amp; PFRS (group VS-17)
Responsible (R): Finance / Actuarial
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly/quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4547_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4547_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4547_Task6" name="Finance/Tax prepare statutory statements (domicile) and the group…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/Tax prepare statutory statements (domicile) and the group consolidation/elimination of the captive (VS-17/W4535), with intercompany settlement
Responsible (R): Finance / Tax
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4547_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4547_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4547_Task7" name="Captive Board/CFO report captive financials to the group board (VS-36)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Captive Board/CFO report captive financials to the group board (VS-36), regulators (W4548), and stakeholders, with management discussion
Responsible (R): Captive Board / CFO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4547_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4547_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4547_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4547_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-691 (ensure controlled execution — Captive Claims, Finance, Regulatory &amp; Portfolio Analytics (PA-153.3).) | - CTL-691: captive books statutory &amp; PFRS-compliant (VS-17); consolidated/eliminated (W4535); board &amp; regulator-reported
Owner: Finance (VS-17) / Captive Board / Treasury (VS-18)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4547_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4547_Annotation9" targetRef="W4547_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
