    <bpmn:process id="W_W4548" name="W4548. Captive Regulatory Compliance, RBC &amp; Domicile Filings" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Regulatory cycle; capital event; rule change
Frequency: Annual + ongoing
Volume: Captive regulatory compliance (domicile RBC, filings)
Owner: Compliance (VS-22) / Legal (VS-100.3) / Captive Board
Participants: Finance (VS-17), Actuarial, Tax (VS-79), Domiciliary regulator
Source: workflow W4548 — Captive Regulatory Compliance, RBC &amp; Domicile Filings</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4548_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4548_Lane1" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4548_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4548_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4548_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4548_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4548_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4548_Start3" name="Regulatory cycle; capital event; rule change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4548_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4548_Task4" name="Compliance/Finance monitor &amp; maintain RBC/capital adequacy (domicile risk-based…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compliance/Finance monitor &amp; maintain RBC/capital adequacy (domicile risk-based capital) for the captive, with capital actions if below required
Responsible (R): Compliance / Finance / Actuarial
Accountable (A): CFO / Captive Board
Duration: Annual + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4548_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4548_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
