    <bpmn:process id="W_W4552" name="W4552. Captive Performance Review, Run-Off &amp; Strategic Options" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual review; strategic shift; underperformance
Frequency: Annual + on trigger
Volume: Captive performance review &amp; strategic-options assessment
Owner: CFO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Captive Board / Strategy (VS-33)
Participants: Risk (VS-21.2), Treasury (VS-18), Legal (VS-100.3), M&amp;A (VS-130)
Source: workflow W4552 — Captive Performance Review, Run-Off &amp; Strategic Options</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4552_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4552_Lane1" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4552_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4552_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4552_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4552_Lane2" name="Captive Board">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4552_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4552_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4552_Start4" name="Annual review; strategic shift; underperformance">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4552_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4552_Task5" name="CFO/Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk/Strategy review captive performance vs the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CFO/Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk/Strategy review captive performance vs the W4529 business-case success metrics (cost-of-risk reduction, combined ratio, capital efficiency), and the strategic rationale
Responsible (R): CFO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Strategy
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4552_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4552_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4552_Task6" name="CFO/Strategy/Captive Board evaluate strategic options (continue/expand…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CFO/Strategy/Captive Board evaluate strategic options (continue/expand, restructure scope, run-off/commute, redomesticate, divest) if performance/rationale changes
Responsible (R): CFO / Strategy / Captive Board / Legal
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: On trigger</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4552_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4552_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4552_Task7" name="Captive Board/CFO execute the chosen path (expand W4530, run-off W4541…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Captive Board/CFO execute the chosen path (expand W4530, run-off W4541 commutation, or wind-down via VS-130/M&amp;A-type transaction), reporting to the board (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Captive Board / CFO / Legal
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4552_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4552_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4552_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4552_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-691 (ensure controlled execution — Captive Claims, Finance, Regulatory &amp; Portfolio Analytics (PA-153.3).) | - CTL-691: captive performance reviewed vs success metrics (W4529); strategic-options assessed; wind-down via VS-130/M&amp;A discipline if chosen
Owner: CFO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk / Captive Board / Strategy (VS-33)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
